1f"},{"place_name":"棘城","place_name_jianti_auto":"棘城","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"9d2b3d18-db0e-11ef-a3bd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"營州郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"营州郡","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"9d2b3d19-db0e-11ef-af6f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"廆自徒河之青山徙大棘城。杜佑曰：棘城，卽帝顓頊之墟，在營州郡城東南一百七十里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"廆自徒河之青山徙大棘城。杜佑曰：棘城，即帝颛顼之墟，在营州郡城东南一百七十里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"9d2b3d11-db0e-11ef-b1bd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":269,"link_death_year":333,"link_td_description":"慕容廆，字弈洛瓌，昌黎棘城（今辽宁义县）人。晋朝时鲜卑人，慕容部首领慕容涉归之子，前燕奠基人慕容皝之父。其孙慕容儁建立前燕之后，追尊武宣皇帝。吐谷浑第一代首领慕容吐谷浑是其庶兄。","link_td_id":"Q10000872","link_td_number_id":211298,"people_name":"慕容廆","people_name_jianti_auto":"慕容廆","people_xingming":"慕容廆","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"9d2b3d1a-db0e-11ef-8287-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"9d2b3d10-db0e-11ef-b546-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"wěi","source_anchor_text":"肅然慕容廆徙居大棘","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":3,"text":"廆","tongjian_id":"e544076e-8a05-55c7-90f8-3de160e80a33"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"大棘城","place_name_jianti_auto":"大棘城","resolved_place_entity_id":6407,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"9d2b3d1b-db0e-11ef-a2b2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十一、万全都指挥使司开平、大宁二卫及诸裔附（卷十八）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"建兴初，幽州都督王浚檄慕容廆讨辽西鲜卑段疾陆眷。廆遣子翰...","context_before":"...东百九十里。汉县，属辽西郡。后汉属辽东属国。魏省入昌黎。","source_end_index":64,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"641c4344-e4aa-5c54-b5a6-13c8e87d3989","source_start_index":35,"source_text":"晋太康十年，慕容廆以辽东僻远，徙居徒河之青山。寻又徙棘城。"},{"context_after":"咸康四年，石虎攻慕容皝于棘城，败还。后魏太平真君八年，并...","context_before":"...莫护跋从司马懿伐公孙渊有功，拜率义王，始建国于棘城之北。","source_end_index":87,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"23dca39e-11e6-5a6e-8e8a-5563fa0e5f6d","source_start_index":61,"source_text":"晋元康四年，莫护跋之孙慕容廆徙居大棘城，因置棘城县。"}],"path":"北直方舆纪要/十一、万全都指挥使司开平、大宁二卫及诸裔附（卷十八）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"5慕容廆徙居大棘城。","content_fanyi":"慕容廆迁居大棘城。","content_jianti_auto":"5慕容廆徙居大棘城。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":7070,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"9d2b3d10-db0e-11ef-b546-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":294,"link_td_description":"拓跋弗，中国西晋时期索头部鲜卑族领袖，293年至294年在位，是南北朝时期北魏皇帝的先祖。其父为拓跋沙漠汗，前任首领拓跋绰是其叔父。293年，因拓跋绰去世而继位。294年去世，其另一叔父拓跋禄官继立。子拓跋郁律，后也成为首领。北魏道武帝拓跋珪称帝时，将其追谥为思皇帝。","link_td_id":"Q10008806","link_td_number_id":383490,"people_name":"拓跋弗","people_name_jianti_auto":"拓跋弗","people_xingming":"拓跋弗","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"9d2b3d1d-db0e-11ef-ae04-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":307,"link_td_description":"拓跋禄官，中国西晋时期鲜卑索头部首领，294年至307年在位，是南北朝时期北魏皇帝的先祖。其父为拓跋力微，拓跋沙漠汗、拓跋悉鹿、拓跋绰皆为其兄弟。294年，前任首领即禄官之侄拓跋弗去世，禄官因此继位。295年，禄官继位后将国土为三部：由自己统治东部；禄官之侄，即沙漠汗之子拓跋猗㐌统治中部；而沙漠汗另一子，猗㐌之弟拓跋猗卢统治西部。307年禄官去世，因猗㐌已于305年去世，因此猗卢便合并三部。北魏道武帝拓跋珪称帝时，将禄官追谥为昭皇帝。后代有拓跋颓。","link_td_id":"Q10008812","link_td_number_id":383668,"people_name":"祿官","people_name_jianti_auto":"禄官","people_xingming":"拓跋禄官","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"9d2b3d1e-db0e-11ef-b946-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"6拓跋弗卒，叔父祿官立。","content_fanyi":"拓跋弗去世，叔父拓跋禄官继位。","content_jianti_auto":"6拓跋弗卒，叔父禄官立。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":7071,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"9d2b3d1c-db0e-11ef-8539-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"四年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"四年","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"9d2b3ce4-db0e-11ef-b8fe-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（甲寅、二九四）","year_int":294},"message":"success","success":true}